ghtop (3.6.0-r1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Rosepetal packaging of ghtop, an htop fork that adds:
    - GPU usage bar in the default header layout
    - Temperatures meter (CPU/GPU/PCH/RAM/NVMe/NIC)
    - GPUMEM and GMEM% per-process columns (NVML-backed)
    - DOCKER per-process column resolving cgroup ids via `docker ps`
  * Binary installed as /usr/bin/ghtop to coexist with system htop.

 -- Rosepetal <dev@rosepetal.ai>  Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
